.TH SQ 1 1.4.0 "Sequoia PGP" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sq\-config\-template \- Write a template configuration file
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.br
\fBsq config template\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR]  
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Write a template configuration file.
.PP
Writes a template containing the default values to the given file or stdout.  This can be used as a starting point to tweak the configuration.
.PP

.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.SS "Subcommand options"
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR=\fIFILE\fR
Write to FILE or stdout if omitted
.IP
[default: \fB\-\fR]
.SS "Global options"
See \fBsq\fR(1) for a description of the global options.
.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
.PP

.PP
Write a template configuration.
.PP
.nf
.RS
sq config template
.RE
.fi
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.nh
\fBsq\fR(1), \fBsq\-config\fR(1).
.hy
.PP
For the full documentation see <https://book.sequoia\-pgp.org>.
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
1.4.0
